# Local env template — copy to `.env.local` for development.
# On Vercel these are set in Project Settings → Environment Variables instead.
#
# Only the two PUBLIC variables below belong in the frontend. The Supabase
# `service_role` secret key must never be placed here or in any VITE_ var.

# Supabase project URL (Project Settings → API → Project URL)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co

# Supabase publishable (anon) API key (Project Settings → API → Project API Keys)
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_YOUR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The agent-runner Edge Function needs NO variable here.
#
# Its URL is derived at runtime from VITE_SUPABASE_URL as
# `<VITE_SUPABASE_URL>/functions/v1/agent-runner` (see src/lib/agentRunner.ts),
# and it is called with the signed-in user's own Supabase access token.
#
# The runner's secrets — SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY and the
# rest — live ONLY in the Edge Function environment. They are documented in
# supabase/README.md and supabase/secrets.example, and must never be added here
# or given a VITE_ prefix, because Vite inlines every VITE_ variable into the
# public JavaScript bundle.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase dashboard configuration required by the auth flows in this app
# (these are project settings, NOT environment variables):
#
#   Auth → Providers → Email          : enabled (password sign-up/sign-in)
#   Auth → Providers → Google         : enabled (OAuth)
#   Auth → URL Configuration → Site URL:
#       https://your-production-domain
#   Auth → URL Configuration → Redirect URLs (allow-list every origin):
#       http://localhost:5173/**
#       https://your-vercel-preview-domain/**
#       https://your-production-domain/**
#     The password-reset email links to `<origin>/reset-password`, and the
#     sign-up confirmation email links to `<origin>/workspace`, so both paths
#     must be covered by the wildcards above.
